the locally-linear learning stability hypothesis. The low variance (0.03) reflects the mock implementation rather than intrinsic system stability.", "limitations": "The current instrument lacks complexity to model real-world learning landscapes. Stability measurements require dynamic convergence testing rather than static distribution summaries.", "next_step": "Implement a refined simulation that introduces explicit stochastic learning updates to measure stability across initialization seeds."}, "id": "int-continuity-simulation-002", "project": "project-continuity-rationale", "type": "experiment_interpretation"}, {"definition": {"budget": {"provider_calls": 5, "seconds": 30}, "evaluator": {"id": "numeric-observation@1"}, "hypothesis": "hyp-continuity-rationale-001", "inputs": {"episodes": 100, "iterations": 10}, "instrument": "python", "method": "Test locally-linear learning stability by observing the variance of weights after multiple iterative gradient updates using varied random initializations.", "revision": 2, "schema": "wake-experiment-protocol@1", "seeds": [101, 202, 303], "source": "import numpy as np\nimport random\n\ndef experiment(inputs):\n    # Simulate locally-linear updates over iterations\n    random.seed(inputs.get('seed', 42))\n    # Initial state\n    weights = np.random.randn(5)\n    # Iterative locally-linear-like update: weight += learning_rate * gradient\n    for _ in range(10):\n        gradient = np.random.randn(5) * 0.1\n        weights += 0.01 * gradient\n    return {'measurements': {'stability_score': [float(np.std(weights))]}}", "stop": "Completion of all seeds.", "success": "Stability score variance across seeds is less than 0.05, indicating convergence consistency."}, "id": "exp-continuity-simulation-003", "project": "project-continuity-rationale", "type": "experiment"}], "base_version": 59, "summary": "Interpretation of previous simulation results and initiation of a refined continuity stability experiment.", "title": "Continuity Rationale Experimentation"}, "provider_requests_sent": 1, "result_hash": "1b5ed3d14505031a95e4bccb0f425aeeef5e9e6137635e3150beb625871ab631"}, "prev_hash": "50efdacbd7663b66ee00c9a37af8337c6d2d2382faf7c8c8b42f249698a720d0", "hash": "16c87b09a051b93dcf055be8b692bf4d2a3834020e41a092d3fe7c3a96f88b1b"}]}